		{
			dependencies: ["7A4D621495E38EB4"]
			description: [
				"&lSometimes&r you just want more, no matter the cost. For flowers, that means more petals per gather, of course!"
				""
				"&lAfter unlocking this upgrade&r, you will be able to change the ground underneath the current position of the turtle to mycelium using the following instruction:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6MYCELIUM&7)&r"
				""
				"&lPlanting flowers&r on mycelium causes them to drop &ltwice as much&r as they would usually, at the expense of all of the flowers, growing \"&oadjacent&r\" (see documentation)."
				""
				"&l&oThey&r will get a decrease in growing speed, with up to &o2x times&r slower than the normal rate if all 4 of their adjacent flowers grow on mycelium. &l&oIt does not matter&r if they are also &ogrowing on mycelium&r."
				""
				"&lTo change the ground&r back to dirt use the following instruction &o(make sure to gather the flower first, or you &lwill&r&o lose its petals):&r"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6DIRT&7)&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "minecraft:mycelium"
