		{
			dependencies: ["7A4D621495E38EB4"]
			description: [
				"&lSometimes&r waiting for a flower to grow can feel like an eternity. &oLuckily,&r there are a couple of ways to solve this problem! &lThe easiest one&r for you to access right now, of course, being &lwater&r."
				""
				"&lAfter unlocking this upgrade&r, you will be able to change the ground currently below the turtle by using the following instruction:"
				""
				"&7turtle.&6changeGround&7(consts.&6GROUND_TYPES&7.&6WATER&7)&r"
				""
				"&lEvery flower&r that grows in a block \"&oadjacent&r\" (see documentation) to a water block will get a boost in growth speed. The more water sources around the flower - &othe better.&r Up to &o50%&r faster with 4 water block adjacent!"
				""
				"&lThe only drawback&r - scientists have not yet been able to figure out how to plant things on it :(. To change the ground back to dirt, see the quest for &omycelium&r."
			]
