		{
			dependencies: ["521023AD5B705695"]
			description: [
				"&lTired&r of all of these weeds screwing up your perfect garden? &lTry Farmland™!&r"
				""
				"&lFlowers grow slower&r on it by about 30%, however &l&0Mystical Black Flowers&r will not appear on it."
				""
