				"4056522011D612AA"
			]
			description: [
				"&lThe Mystical White Flower&r is the last flower you will get. The chance of it growing is based on how &o\"balanced\"&r your garden is, meaning the more the amount of different colored flowers differs from the amounts of other colored flowers, the &oless likely it is to grow.&r"
				""
				"&lFor you math heads&r, the growth chance follows the formula of:"
				""
				"&o1/(<standard deviation of differently colored flowers> + 1) * 100%&r"
				""
				"&lP.S:&r the formula does not include flowers that cannot be planted, are not present in the garden at all, or the white flowers themselves"
				""
				"&lOh&r, did I mention that this flower requires &oone of every petal to be planted?&r"
				""
				"<glitch f=3 j=0.02 b=0.01 s=0.1><rainb>Good luck! ;)"
			]
